{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"324bb50169fbc52275a3ed8867e142f1cd8cb381e0d66a1eab99d7a9cf19ed9a","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot Gerrit integration","key_entities":["src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py","src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py","src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py","src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py","_summarize()","_translate_findings()","post_vote()","get_revision_files()","build_inline_comments()","render_findings_block()"],"problem_keywords":["advisory findings invisible","review bot","gerrit integration","finding enumeration","message rendering"],"propositions":["Advisory finding text is never rendered on Gerrit changes; only a count-of-findings is published in the review message.","The adapter's _summarize PASS branch and _translate_findings function discard finding location data and never enumerate advisory details.","Robot comments endpoint is unsupported on this Gerrit server, making the review message body the only proven rendering surface.","A new finding_publish module must extract and unify finding enumeration logic so both PASS and BLOCK paths render advisory text in the message and produce inline comments when locations anchor to real files.","Comment posting failures must not be silent; failures degrade to message-only publication with an explicit notice and fallback to the durable code_review artifact."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787309467166003001,"uuid":"a5517fe3-d136-4398-9f05-3d9300f7744a"}